<title>USA: Baltimore, Md., $26.625 mln won by PaineWebber.</title>
<headline>Baltimore, Md., $26.625 mln won by PaineWebber.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber said it won $26.625 million of Baltimore, Md., general obligation consolidated public improvement bonds, 1997 Series A,  with a true interest cost of 5.18 percent.</p>
